# Embed map

# Step 1: PoC
- Proxy map data in live site
    - Set up API-M
    - Add API-M to static web app
        - https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/static-web-apps/apis-api-management
    - Add rewrite to static web app for map data to go to API-M
        - https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/static-web-apps/configuration#example-configuration-file
        - /map/tiles -> api/servermap/tiles
        - /map/sse -> api/servermap/sse
        - /map/images -> api/servermap/images
    - Add wildcard proxy endpoint to API-M
        - api/servermap/* -> https://callmecarson.live/subserver/map/*
- Embed map in a page
    - Use iframe

# Step 2: Map view
- Add my custom waypoints script to the map
    - https://gist.github.com/BadgerCode/1d21d5b6b681fe1e109efc8b80cb003f
    - Add script to files & include in index.html
- Add a maps page to the website which embeds the map

# Step 3: Shop location
- Allow communication between page and embedded map
    - Channel messaging API
    - https://javascriptbit.com/transfer-data-between-parent-window-iframe-channel-messaging-api/
- Allow the page to show custom markers on the map
    - With an info popup
- Add a popup for shops, which shows an embedded map
    - Set the location to the shop's location and use a good zoom level
    - Add a custom marker for the shop, with a popup (title)



